ar" char="."/><col align="char" char="."/></colgroup><thead valign="bottom"><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</th><th colspan="2" align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>Number of patients</bold></th></tr><tr><th align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Site of recurrence</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>R0, <italic>N</italic>=19</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>R1, <italic>N</italic>=7</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Local &#x02013; (resection bed/anastomosis/ local lymph nodes)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Distant<sup>a</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">5</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Local and distant</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">No recurrence</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">9</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Death without documented recurrence</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">2</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t3-fn1"><label>a</label><p>Four patients showed recurrence at more than one site. Sites of distant recurrence included distant nodes (<italic>N</italic>=6), peritoneum (<italic>N</italic>=3), lung (<italic>N</italic>=2), brain (<italic>N</italic>=1), liver (<italic>N</italic>=1) and bone (<italic>N</italic>=1).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>